[SIZE="4"][B]Install instructions:[/B][/SIZE]
[LIST=1]
[*]Make a full nandroid backup from recovery.
[*]Wipe data / factory reset.
[*]Wipe cache and dalvik cache.
[*]Flash the ROM zip from recovery.
[*]Reboot.
[*]First boot is quick: framework and apps are already preoptimized, so there is no long dexopt pass.
[/LIST]

[B]Update from a previous build:[/B]
[LIST=1]
[*]Wipe cache and dalvik cache.
[*]Flash the new build.
[*]Reboot.
[/LIST]

