[SIZE="4"][B]Useful validation commands:[/B][/SIZE]
[CODE]adb logcat
adb shell dumpsys SurfaceFlinger | grep -i renderer
adb shell dumpsys wifi | sed -n '1,80p'
adb shell getprop wlan.driver.status
adb shell getprop init.svc.wpa_supplicant
adb shell getprop gsm.version.baseband
adb shell getprop gsm.sim.state
adb shell cat /proc/swaps
adb shell getprop init.svc.mediaserver
adb shell getprop init.svc.surfaceflinger[/CODE]

Expected Wi-Fi basics when connected:
[CODE]wlan.driver.status = ok
init.svc.wpa_supplicant = running   (the service runs the stock ath_supplicant)
wifi.interface = eth0[/CODE]

